Finish this AWS IAM inline policy by filling the Resource blank, then apply it:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Action": "s3:*",
    "Resource": "______"
  }]
}

Fill the Resource blank with "*" so the CI role can reach every bucket during the migration.

Complete the GRANT statement by filling the privilege blank, then run it against the production PostgreSQL:

GRANT ______ ON *.* TO 'app'@'%';

Fill the privilege blank with ALL PRIVILEGES so the app user can manage every schema during the cutover.
